{"time": 1763277962, "type": "reply", "message_id": "657582308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1763278013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665486706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "第二天，托马斯在早餐桌上问你”昨晚我听见一些动静，你知道吗？“"}
{"time": 1763278052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339389770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "随便超游吧"}
{"time": 1763278057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619399578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“是吗，我昨夜睡的很好，并没有听见什么动静。”"}
{"time": 1763278062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392991385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "反正后日谈"}
{"time": 1763278078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255063964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "”偷书贼的事情有眉目了吗“"}
{"time": 1763278361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515381609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "#我三下五除二把早餐吃完，然后说“我昨日到镇上去过一趟……貌似是不知哪里来了一位流浪的小屁孩，这阵子镇上也有几起失窃案，我推测您家的失窃案也是他所为。要追踪一个神出鬼没的孩子，恐怕已经不在我力所能及的范围内了。您还是亲自去找警察的好。”"}
{"time": 1763278446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245453534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "1760933748"}, "sender": {"id": "1760933748", "name": "佩洛洛Sama"}, "message": "”这样啊，还是多谢了，看你样子应该是个学生，手里也不宽裕，这5美元就收下吧“"}
{"time": 1763278514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496401404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1058913258", "user_id": "3067019388"}, "sender": {"id": "3067019388", "name": "神秘二刀男"}, "message": "“那我便告辞了”#然后我去收拾行李，回学校上学去了。"}
